// The title screen's intro cinematic (docs/design/title-screen.md, *Intro
// cinematic*), played in time with the title song by the title screen
// (ticket 0819).
//
// A STAND-IN until ticket 0820 writes the storyboard's shots: one slow pan
// over the Chapter 1 battlefield, from the party in Harrowby to the
// toll-fort, then the logo from the song's last note (1:57) to its loop.
(
    id: "title",
    length: Music("title"),
    shots: [
        (at: 0.0, shot: MapPan(battle: "ch01", from: (5, 12), to: (18, 4), zoom: 3)),
        (at: 117.0, shot: Logo),
    ],
)
